<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" version="2.0"><channel><atom:link href="https://www.aboutamazon.com/rss/feed.rss" type="application/rss+xml" rel="self"/><title>Amazon News</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link><description>Amazon News RSS Feed</description><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 00:57:49 GMT</lastBuildDate><image><title>Amazon News</title><url>https://assets.aboutamazon.com/f2/a4/a07ef04d49df8b93eb283512a0fc/amazon-news-newsletter-beige.png</url><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link></image><item><title>5 ways Amazon is investing in Connecticut</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-connecticut-jobs-infrastructure-small-business?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon&apos;s investments are boosting the Constitution State&apos;s economy while creating opportunities for Connecticut residents. </description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 16:44:55 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-connecticut-jobs-infrastructure-small-business</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/4ec094a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fe1%2F08%2Fa2588bcb41629279981998e84117%2Fabout-amazon-hero-new-haven-adobestock-475790017.jpg"/></item><item><title>Inside the AWS lab that makes everything you do online feel effortless</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/stories/inside-aws-networking-lab-cupertino?utm_source=rss</link><description>In a nondescript building in Cupertino, California, a team of engineers is quietly designing the networking technology that keeps the modern world connected—one wavelength of light at a time.</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 15:37:49 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/stories/inside-aws-networking-lab-cupertino</guid><category>AWS</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/a2d8779/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F07%2F51%2F7195a5ad434483ecc2c501cf391e%2F2026-awsnetworking-preview-video011-amazon-news-lj-20261002.gif"/></item><item><title>Amazon in the community: Here’s what’s happening in Seattle, Bellevue, and the Puget Sound</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-seattle-bellevue-puget-sound-news?utm_source=rss</link><description>Learn how we invest in the community, help power the local economy, and support our employees in the Puget Sound region.</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 15:26:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-seattle-bellevue-puget-sound-news</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/fa71e99/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1125x1125+438+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Ff2%2Fe4%2F6f67188e480392ce0b19a6671b59%2Fspheres-rolling-blog-hero-1.jpg"/></item><item><title>Amazon&apos;s Holiday Kids Gift Book is back with 600+ toys, games, and gifts for every age</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/amazon-2026-holiday-kids-gift-book?utm_source=rss</link><description>From an interactive Alexa+ story to exclusive Forest Friends gifts, this year&apos;s edition has something for everyone on your list.</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 13:00:05 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/amazon-2026-holiday-kids-gift-book</guid><category>Retail</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/9009498/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fc8%2Fd2%2Fa349d72140c9bd9bf1384b893d71%2Famazon-holiday-kids-gift-book-hero.jpg"/></item><item><title>The race our nation can’t afford to lose, plus a new commitment from us and a fresh set of community investments</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/amazon-data-centers-built-together?utm_source=rss</link><description></description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 08:55:14 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/amazon-data-centers-built-together</guid><category>Company news</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/eb94cec/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F12%2F26%2F200746cc4971855f5828ce07fb38%2Famazondatacenteremployee-hero-amazonnews-ck92926.png"/></item><item><title>How Amazon is helping communities impacted by the Nepal flash floods</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/nepal-floods-amazon-disaster-relief?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon is working with aid organizations to help communities recover following flooding and landslides along the Nepal border.</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 08:34:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/nepal-floods-amazon-disaster-relief</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/3e97f90/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1125x1125+438+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F46%2F9c%2Ff08677644479b0f1a54b464c57f3%2Famazon-disasterrelief-humanitariangoods-nepal-amazonnews-cdlt-2026aug28.png"/></item><item><title>Amazon in the community: Service, community, and commitment at HQ2</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-arlington-virginia-news?utm_source=rss</link><description>Learn how we invest in the community, help power the local economy, and support our employees in the National Capital Region.</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 21:44:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-arlington-virginia-news</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/4923257/2147483647/strip/true/crop/812x812+204+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fe9%2F22%2F1243d8e149e19d8b6b2c4b8066a1%2Faerial-view-of-met-park.jpg"/></item><item><title>5 ways Amazon is investing in New Jersey</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-new-jersey-jobs-infrastructure-small-business?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon&apos;s investments are boosting the Garden State&apos;s economy while creating opportunities for New Jersey residents. </description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 15:29:41 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-investment-new-jersey-jobs-infrastructure-small-business</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/53bc215/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F31%2F9c%2F6c433d2640a693bb62f5a5384128%2Fabout-amazon-hero-mercer-adobestock-541109610.jpg"/></item><item><title>What’s new on Prime Video in October 2026, including ‘Carrie,’ ‘The Terminal List,’ and NBA games</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/prime-video-october-films-shows-sports-2026?utm_source=rss</link><description>Prime Video’s October lineup also features new originals like ‘Masterplan’ and ‘Apocalypse Z 2.’</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 13:15:32 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/prime-video-october-films-shows-sports-2026</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/566be28/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F22%2F71%2F16ff35f94ac4baf62744d6be28d6%2Fprime-video-new-october-hero.jpeg"/></item><item><title>Amazon introduces a completely redesigned Kindle family</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/new-kindle-lineup-2026?utm_source=rss</link><description>The all-new Kindle, Kindle Paperwhite, and Kindle Colorsoft are thinner and lighter with a new display stack and seamless edge-to-edge color across the lineup.</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 12:50:13 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/new-kindle-lineup-2026</guid><category>Devices</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/dd3e7ff/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F21%2Fb1%2Fce065b0b4cd9a58fdf5a2338d72b%2Fsmaller-kindle-edition-hero-ube-amazon-news-lt.gif"/></item></channel></rss>